<h2 id="what-is-a-whatsapp-chatbot"><b>What is a WhatsApp Chatbot?</b></h2>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">A WhatsApp chatbot is an AI-powered conversational software that automates custom communication in WhatsApp using preset rules or AI. Powered by the official WhatsApp Business API, it enables businesses:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Provide 24/7 customer support and answer FAQs instantly</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Capture and qualify leads automatically</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Send order updates, reminders, and broadcasts</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Recommend products based on customer preferences</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Automate customer onboarding</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Integrate with your CRM and existing business tools</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Route complex queries to live agents </span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">When a customer sends messages, the bot reads them, uses AI to understand the customer’s intent, and responds within seconds. WhatsApp automation is divided into two categories. A rule-based chatbot follows a fixed decision tree and works quite well for predictable queries.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">AI-powered chatbots use natural language processing to understand interactions and handle unpredictable queries to offer personalized responses. Using a chatbot, businesses can build an automated conversation flow, improve customer support, collect information, and hand over complex queries to a live agent when needed.</span></p>
